      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَاهِ عَاهِ</span></b>  <i>A cry by which camels are chidden in
order that they may confine themselves to a spot;</i>
as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِيهِ عِيهِ</span>; (K, TA;) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَهْ عَهْ</span>. (TA.)

